Subject: [PATCH] Mombasa auction dashboard on the Markets page

---
 _includes/auction-dashboard.html |  61 ++++++
 assets/dashboard.js              | 323 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 assets/data/mombasa-sales.json   |   5 +
 assets/style.css                 |  52 +++++
 markets.html                     |  14 +-
